{
  "_comment": [
    "Valérian's music (the Hellfire Gaol's third gate, ZealotBoss.cpp), played by our own sound engine as music: the",
    "game's own music silent meanwhile. Each track played once from its phase's start: the fight is timed on it (p1: a",
    "pulse a second from 1.37 s; p2: 92.3 BPM from 1.39 s; plan: .agents/plans/gaol-third), and the server silences it",
    "as it ends - the engine would loop it (loopStart 0) past the track's own fade-out, never reached.",
    "His sounds (Valerian.*): Diablo IV's - Inarius's fight, the Paladin, Akarat's echo, a Knight caster, Mephisto's orb -",
    "picked by the user on the audition page (2026-10-11), each take whole (the bank's sub-bass stream mixed in), the two",
    "played at random. Levelled on their loudest 0.4 s at -9 dBFS RMS, as Vrogar's; the orb reaching him at half volume",
    "(one every 2 s). Those tied to a spot fade with distance (full within 6 yd, gone at 45); the arena's heard everywhere."
  ],
